      "title": "DNA Replication — Steps & Enzymes",
      "competency": "STEM_BIO11/12-IIIa-b-5",
      "content": "<h3>🎯 Learning Objectives</h3><ul><li>Describe the steps of DNA replication.</li><li>Identify enzymes involved.</li><li>Explain semi-conservative replication.</li><li>Diagram the replication fork.</li></ul><h3>🔑 Key Concepts</h3><ul><li><strong>Semi-conservative</strong> — each new DNA has one old + one new strand.</li><li><strong>Replication fork</strong> — the Y-shaped region where DNA unwinds.</li><li><strong>Helicase</strong> — unwinds DNA.</li><li><strong>DNA polymerase</strong> — adds nucleotides.</li><li><strong>Ligase</strong> — seals fragments.</li></ul><h3>📚 Lesson Content</h3><h4>A. Steps of Replication</h4><ol><li><strong>Initiation:</strong> Helicase unwinds DNA at origin of replication</li><li><strong>Elongation:</strong> Primase lays RNA primer; DNA polymerase adds nucleotides (5'→3')</li><li><strong>Lagging strand:</strong> Made in Okazaki fragments</li><li><strong>Termination:</strong> Ligase seals fragments; two identical DNA molecules result</li></ol><h4>B. Enzymes Summary</h4><table><thead><tr><th>Enzyme</th><th>Function</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Helicase</td><td>Unwinds double helix</td></tr><tr><td>Primase</td><td>Synthesizes RNA primer</td></tr><tr><td>DNA polymerase</td><td>Adds DNA nucleotides</td></tr><tr><td>Ligase</td><td>Seals Okazaki fragments</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "activity1": {
        "timeLimit": 90,
        "badgeId": "replication-master",
        "badgeName": "Replication Master",
        "badgeIcon": "🧬",
        "pairs": [
          { "key": "semi", "left": "Semi-conservative", "right": "One old + one new strand" },
          { "key": "fork", "left": "Replication fork", "right": "Y-shaped region" },
          { "key": "heli", "left": "Helicase", "right": "Unwinds double helix" },
          { "key": "prim", "left": "Primase", "right": "Lays RNA primer" },
          { "key": "pol", "left": "DNA polymerase", "right": "Adds DNA nucleotides" },
          { "key": "lig", "left": "Ligase", "right": "Seals Okazaki fragments" },
          { "key": "oko", "left": "Okazaki fragments", "right": "Lagging strand segments" }
        ]
      },
